{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PUNCH FOREVER is a physics-based brawler, the ultimate version of the Ludum Dare 54 game jam winner <i>Fun #1</i>, featuring new game modes on top the original level campaign: a 2-player battle arena and a hardcore survival mode.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LIMITED SPACE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >26 original  levels with fair challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the timings to perfect your reflexes and accuracy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hardcore mode to fight off enemy waves and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your abilities and unlock new perks by clearing stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARENA</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb up the ladder by fighting opponents and raising bets by your rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or smash your friend at <strong>2-player hot seat</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > FOREVER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t\tAvailable for <strong>FREE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for PUNCH FOREVER <i><strong>on mobile</strong> to play with touch controls</i>.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"BASICS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4106530/9e3802b15e9a439d26510f7cb59776c72c29222c.jpg"},{"name":"GOOD START","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4106530/d7f49a7c5e86149ba81d3cd943b55a4644d486e4.jpg"},{"name":"DOMINATION","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4106530/ddaedb456c2b2b39644d2eec6fe4bb4d063090d9.jpg"},{"name":"BIG NOSE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4106530/8af4eeaea6f468bbe306e2e081ac29d5335323be.jpg"},{"name":"LIMITED SPACE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4106530/05987489e4e73c21f9